# Formspree form ID for the contact form. Get it from the form's endpoint URL:
# https://formspree.io/f/<id>
#
# This is NOT a secret. Anything prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the client
# bundle at build time, and a Formspree form ID is a public endpoint by design
# -- it identifies the form, it does not authorise anything.
#
# It still has to be set wherever the site is built. Without it the contact
# form renders as email-only rather than posting to /f/undefined and failing
# in front of whoever was trying to get in touch.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
